#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1381
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_GymSign"
msgid ""
"SOOTOPOLIS CITY POKéMON GYM\n"
"LEADER: JUAN\p"
"“The GYM LEADER with the beauty\n"
"of pure water!”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1387
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_CitySign"
msgid ""
"SOOTOPOLIS CITY\p"
"“The mystical city where history\n"
"slumbers.”$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1392
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_DoorIsClosed"
msgid "The door is closed.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1395
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_PhysicallyFitLivingHere"
msgid ""
"Diving in the sea. Climbing up and\n"
"down stairs all the time…\p"
"If you live in this town, you end up\n"
"getting physically fit.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1401
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_GiantPokemonSuddenlyAppeared"
msgid ""
"These giant POKéMON suddenly appeared\n"
"in the middle of the city!\p"
"And, I've never seen them before!\p"
"Why are they smashing into each\n"
"other like that?\p"
"Why can't they be friends, those\n"
"POKéMON?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1410
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_WhatIsThatGreenPokemon"
msgid ""
"What? What? What?\n"
"What is that green POKéMON?!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1414
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_WhereDidLegendariesGo"
msgid ""
"GROUDON and KYOGRE…\n"
"Where did they go?\p"
"Will they cause droughts or downpours\n"
"somewhere else?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1420
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_TwoPokemonArentAngry"
msgid ""
"I just get this sense somehow that\n"
"the two POKéMON aren't angry.\p"
"I think… They probably can't control\n"
"their own power…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1426
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_FlyingMonStoppedRampage"
msgid ""
"That flying POKéMON came down from\n"
"the sky and stopped the rampaging\l"
"POKéMON…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1431
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_WonderWhatWorldIsLike"
msgid ""
"I… I've never been out of this city.\p"
"I wonder what the world is like on\n"
"the other side of this round sky?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1436
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_ThisIsWicked"
msgid ""
"Wow!\n"
"This is wicked!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1440
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_ThatWasWicked"
msgid ""
"Wow!\n"
"That was wicked!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1444
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_GoRedAndBlueMon"
msgid ""
"Go for it, red POKéMON!\n"
"Don't back off, blue POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1448
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_DoYouKnowMonNames"
msgid ""
"… … … … … …\p"
"Hi, do you know the names of those\n"
"POKéMON fighting over there?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1453
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_GreenOneSettlesThings"
msgid ""
"I was wondering which one would win,\n"
"the red one or the blue one, but, oh no,\l"
"it's the green one that settles things!\p"
"Talk about a huge turn of events!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1459
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_SeeingLegendWithOwnEyes"
msgid ""
"There's an ancient legend that claims\n"
"the land and sea were shaped by\l"
"a colossal battle between POKéMON.\p"
"Well, I'm seeing that happen with\n"
"my very own eyes!\p"
"Whoa! I never expected to be\n"
"witness to something this huge!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1468
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_SawLegendWithOwnEyes"
msgid ""
"There's an ancient legend that claims\n"
"the land and sea were shaped by\l"
"a colossal battle between POKéMON.\p"
"Well, I saw that happen with\n"
"my very own eyes!\p"
"Whoa! I never expected to be\n"
"witness to something this huge!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1477
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_BigPokemonFighting"
msgid ""
"A big POKéMON is fighting with\n"
"another big POKéMON!\p"
"Please, someone make them stop!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1482
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_PrettyMonCameFromSky"
msgid ""
"A pretty POKéMON came down from\n"
"the sky…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1486
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_SootopolisWillBeWrecked"
msgid ""
"Oh, no!\n"
"SOOTOPOLIS CITY will get wrecked!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1490
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_SootopolisDidntGetWrecked"
msgid "SOOTOPOLIS CITY didn't get wrecked!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1493
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_NoOrdinaryTourist"
msgid ""
"Hm!\n"
"You've come all the way to SOOTOPOLIS?\l"
"You're no ordinary tourist.\p"
"But I suppose that doesn't make you\n"
"an extraordinary tourist, either.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1500
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_CityRegainedCalm"
msgid "The city has regained its calm…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1503
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_CaveOfOriginPleaseLeave"
msgid ""
"Who might you be?\p"
"This is the CAVE OF ORIGIN.\p"
"The spirits of POKéMON, becalmed at\n"
"MT. PYRE, are said to be revived here.\p"
"Please leave.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1510
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_LeadSuperiorTrainerToCave"
msgid ""
"A person with a strong will and\n"
"superior talent…\p"
"A TRAINER who has knowledge and\n"
"experience of many kinds of POKéMON…\p"
"If such a person were to appear, I was\n"
"instructed by WALLACE to lead that\l"
"TRAINER to this CAVE.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1519
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_AwakenedPokemonClash"
msgid ""
"Oh, my…\p"
"The clash between the two awakened\n"
"POKéMON was quelled by the awakening\l"
"of a third POKéMON…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1525
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_CaveOfOriginSleepsToo"
msgid ""
"This is the CAVE OF ORIGIN…\p"
"With the passing of the crisis,\n"
"the cave, too, shall sleep…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1530
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_SootopolisSkyBeautiful"
msgid ""
"SOOTOPOLIS sprang up as a town in\n"
"the crater of a volcano.\p"
"If you look up at the sky, the lip of\n"
"the crater is also visible.\l"
"So, all you see is the sky in a circle.\p"
"But that's what makes the sky above\n"
"SOOTOPOLIS the most beautiful.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1539
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_GiganticPokemonFight"
msgid ""
"When two POKéMON that gigantic\n"
"are fighting that savagely, there's\l"
"not much that we can do.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1544
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_FearedWorstWhenPokemonFlewDown"
msgid ""
"When that third POKéMON flew down,\n"
"I feared the worst.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1548
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_NightSkyFavoriteScenery"
msgid ""
"A circle of a night sky framed by\n"
"the crater of a volcano…\p"
"And in that ring, stars flicker and\n"
"blink as if they were alive…\l"
"It's my favorite scenery.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1555
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_WeatherWentWild"
msgid ""
"The weather was clear this morning,\n"
"but…\p"
"All of a sudden, dark clouds brewed up,\n"
"rain started falling in sheets, and\l"
"there was thunder and lightning, too.\p"
"The weather just went completely\n"
"wild!\p"
"Is all of this because of those\n"
"POKéMON?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1566
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_YouBroughtFlyingMon"
msgid ""
"Oh?\p"
"It was you who brought that flying\n"
"POKéMON here?\p"
"Well, aren't you amazing!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1572
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_GroudonPleaseStop"
msgid ""
"MAXIE: G… GROUDON…\n"
"Please! Stop what you're doing!\p"
"I know the extent of your power now!\p"
"If you keep going, all HOENN, not just\n"
"SOOTOPOLIS, will be utterly ruined!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1579
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_AfterAllOurScheming"
msgid ""
"MAXIE: So the super-ancient POKéMON\n"
"weren't only GROUDON and KYOGRE…\p"
"After all our fruitless scheming and\n"
"frantic efforts, that one POKéMON's\l"
"simple action puts everything right\l"
"again as if nothing had happened…\p"
"Fu…\n"
"Fuhahaha…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1589
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_KyogreCalmDown"
msgid ""
"ARCHIE: KYOGRE! What's wrong?!\n"
"Look over here! It's the RED ORB!\l"
"Calm down! KYOGRE!\p"
"… … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … …\p"
"It's no good!\n"
"It's not responding at all!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1598
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_TryingMeaninglessToPokemon"
msgid ""
"ARCHIE: KYOGRE and GROUDON both\n"
"flew off to who knows where.\p"
"The weather in HOENN has returned\n"
"to its normal state…\p"
"Haha…\n"
"Hahaha…\p"
"Maybe what we were trying to do was\n"
"something small, even meaningless,\l"
"to POKéMON…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1609
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_InvolvedWithCrisisComeWithMe"
msgid ""
"STEVEN: Those POKéMON fighting…\n"
"GROUDON… And KYOGRE…\p"
"The two super-ancient POKéMON\n"
"were awakened from a long sleep…\p"
"And now they are smashing each other\n"
"with their uncontrollable energy…\p"
"…{PLAYER}{KUN}.\p"
"You being here now I'll take to mean\n"
"that you're prepared to become\l"
"involved in this crisis.\p"
"Well, then, there's someone that\n"
"I'd like you to meet.\p"
"Come with me, please.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1624
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_DoesThisMakeYourFearPokemon"
msgid ""
"STEVEN: Listen, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\p"
"Does seeing GROUDON and KYOGRE make\n"
"you think POKéMON are to be feared?\p"
"But that's not true.\n"
"POKéMON are really more…\p"
"…Why am I asking you this?\n"
"You already know.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1633
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_HereWereAreHelpWallace"
msgid ""
"STEVEN: Okay, here we are!\p"
"Inside here you'll find someone named\n"
"WALLACE.\p"
"I think you have what's needed to\n"
"help him…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1640
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_KnowWhatsNeededToHelpHim"
msgid ""
"STEVEN: I think you have what's\n"
"needed to help him…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1644
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_NeverBeenToSkyPillar"
msgid ""
"STEVEN: The SKY PILLAR…\p"
"I've never been there.\n"
"I wonder where it could be?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1649
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_SoThatsRayquaza"
msgid ""
"STEVEN: So that's RAYQUAZA…\p"
"It's incredible how the two rampaging\n"
"POKéMON would flee from it in fear…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1654
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_MaxieArchieLeft"
msgid ""
"STEVEN: It looks like both MAXIE and\n"
"ARCHIE have gone away somewhere.\p"
"Perhaps they've gone to MT. PYRE to\n"
"return those ORBS…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1660
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_HaventYouScaledSkyPillar"
msgid ""
"WALLACE: Oh?\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}?\p"
"Haven't you scaled the SKY PILLAR\n"
"yet?\p"
"I'm sure that you can make it to\n"
"the top of the SKY PILLAR…$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1668
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_AquaMagmaDidntMeanHarm"
msgid ""
"WALLACE: {PLAYER}{KUN}…\p"
"The leaders of TEAM MAGMA and AQUA,\n"
"I don't think they meant harm.\p"
"It wouldn't hurt to hear what they\n"
"have to say for themselves.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1675
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_ThankYouForHelpAcceptThis"
msgid ""
"WALLACE: {PLAYER}{KUN}…\n"
"My eyes didn't deceive me.\p"
"Thanks to your help, SOOTOPOLIS…\n"
"No, all of HOENN was saved.\p"
"On behalf of the people, I thank you.\p"
"This is a gift from me.\n"
"Please accept it.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1684
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_ExplainWaterfallGoToGym"
msgid ""
"That HIDDEN MACHINE contains\n"
"WATERFALL.\p"
"If you have the RAIN BADGE, a POKéMON\n"
"that has learned that HM move can\l"
"force its way up waterfalls.\p"
"And where does one get the RAIN BADGE?\n"
"You know, don't you?\p"
"That's right! You have to beat\n"
"the SOOTOPOLIS GYM LEADER.\p"
"When you're all set to go, step through\n"
"that door.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity/scripts.inc:1697
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_Text_DazzledByMentor"
msgid ""
"WALLACE: I'm sure that you will be\n"
"dazzled by my mentor's breathtakingly\l"
"elegant battle style.$"
msgstr ""
